msgstr "Quellpaket *ucs-school-umc-diagnostic* in Version ``3.0.0``:"

#: ../../changelog.rst:64
msgid ""
"Usernames which do not comply with Windows naming conventions are now "
"shown as critical errors in the system diagnostic tool."
msgstr ""
